-- PC-56 TENANT-SW-b · D · "A REJECTION IS A TO-DO LIST, NOT A VERDICT" (canon W203: "rejection_reason is always translated + paired with
-- the fix"). The eleven `scheme_applications.rejection_reason_code` values (the 0106 CHECK) each get a LABEL and a FIX in every language a
-- member is told in. The schemes desk (SchemeDeskService.pipeline) reads these rows and prints them beside the code — never a key, never
-- a translation typed into a page. A code with no row here prints the code alone (the desk names the gap).
-- ==================================================================================================================
ON CONFLICT (key, language_code) DO NOTHING;
